 readonly List<FieldFlight> fieldFlights=new();readonly List<FieldArea> fieldAreas=new();readonly List<FieldBurn> fieldBurns=new();readonly Dictionary<string,FieldLure> fieldLured=new();readonly Dictionary<string,double> fieldStuns=new();
 int fieldSerial;bool fieldDecoyEmission;double fieldTime;readonly Dictionary<string,double> fieldThrowReady=new();
 void FieldKitAction(string data){if(CoopClient||data.Length>80)return;var b=data.Split('|');if(b.Length!=2||!int.TryParse(b[1],out int n))return;
  if(b[0]=="arrow"&&n>=0&&n<6)game.Change(()=>game.Craft.ArrowType=n);
  if(b[0]=="throw"&&n>=-1&&n<10)game.Change(()=>game.Craft.Throwable=n);
  if(b[0]=="tool"&&n>=0&&n<3&&game.Craft.ToolLevels[n]>0){game.Change(()=>game.Craft.HarvestTool=n);if(coopActor==0){axeEquipped=true;BuildHeldTool();}}
  if(b[0]=="craft"&&n>=0&&n<ExpeditionRecipe.All.Length&&(ExpeditionRecipe.All[n].Kind=="fieldkit"||ExpeditionRecipe.All[n].Kind=="tool"||ExpeditionRecipe.All[n].Kind=="weapon"&&ExpeditionRecipe.All[n].Result==34))game.CraftRecipe(ExpeditionRecipe.All[n]);
 }
 void ShowFieldKit(){var b=Panel("FIELD KIT / AMMUNITION, THROWABLES AND TOOLS");coopMenu="fieldkit";Text(b,$"F3 field kit / G throw selected item / T equip selected harvesting tool. Raw scrap {game.Craft.ScrapMetal} / glass {game.Craft.Glass} / fuel {game.Craft.Fuel}. Search workshop tool chests for your first raw scrap. Salvage cars with a screwdriver, wrench or blowtorch.");
  void Act(string title,string command){Button(b,title,()=>{if(command.StartsWith("tool|"))axeEquipped=true;if(!CoopRequest("fieldkit",command))FieldKitAction(command);ShowFieldKit();});}
  Text(b,"ARROWS / bonus damage is added per impact; flaming arrows burn for 4 damage each second for 5 seconds.");for(int i=0;i<6;i++){int n=i;Act((game.Craft.ArrowType==n?"SELECTED / ":"SELECT / ")+ExpeditionGame.ArrowNames[n]+$" / +{ExpeditionGame.ArrowBonus[n]} DAMAGE / {game.Craft.ArrowsOf(n)}", "arrow|"+n);}
  Act("SELECT / STONE DISTRACTION / 1 STONE", "throw|-1");Text(b,"Molotov: 6 damage/s, 6s ground fire. Thickened: 14 damage/s, 12s ground fire. Nail jar: up to 70 blast damage / 4m. Grenade: up to 140 / 6m. Smoke: 18s. Flash: 5s disruption. Decoy: 20s.");Text(b,"THROWABLES / blast and fire can hurt you. Smoke colors have identical concealment. Flash disrupts ordinary hostiles; bosses resist it. Decoys return undisturbed infected to their prior position after 20 seconds.");for(int i=0;i<10;i++)Act((game.Craft.Throwable==i?"SELECTED / ":"SELECT / ")+ExpeditionGame.ThrowableNames[i]+" / "+game.Craft.ThrowStock[i],"throw|"+i);
  for(int i=0;i<3;i++)if(game.Craft.ToolLevels[i]>0)Act("EQUIP / "+ExpeditionGame.HarvestToolName(i,game.Craft.ToolLevels[i])+" / "+game.HarvestPower(i)+" HARVEST DAMAGE","tool|"+i);
  Text(b,"CRAFT / research is shared with the main research tree. T1 basics are free; higher tiers require the matching workshop and blueprint. Upgraded skinning knives shorten harvesting without changing 200% / 50% yields.");
  foreach(var pair in ExpeditionRecipe.All.Select((r,i)=>(r,i)).Where(p=>p.r.Kind=="fieldkit"||p.r.Kind=="tool"||p.r.Kind=="weapon"&&p.r.Result==34)){int index=pair.i;var r=pair.r;string cost=string.Join(", ",Enumerable.Range(0,7).Where(i=>r.Cost[i]>0).Select(i=>r.Cost[i]+" "+ExpeditionGame.ResourceNames[i]));if(r.Scrap>0)cost+=$", {r.Scrap} raw scrap";if(r.Kind=="fieldkit"){var f=FieldRecipe.All[r.Result];if(f.Glass>0)cost+=$", {f.Glass} glass";if(f.Fuel>0)cost+=$", {f.Fuel} fuel";if(f.Bone>0)cost+=$", {f.Bone} bone";}PackLabel(b,$"T{r.Tier} / {r.Name} / {cost}",13);string why=game.RecipeReason(r);if(why=="Ready")Act("CRAFT / "+r.Name,"craft|"+index);else{PackLabel(b,why,12);if(!game.Knows(r))Button(b,"RESEARCH / "+r.Name,()=>{researchTab=game.ResearchTab(r);researchChoice=index;ShowResearchTree();});}}
  Button(b,"HUNTING / FLINT KNIFE AND SKINNING",ShowHunting);Text(b,game.Notice);Button(b,"BACK",CloseMenu);
 }
 WorldProp AimedFieldResource(){var q=PhysicsRayQueryParameters3D.Create(camera.GlobalPosition,camera.GlobalPosition-camera.GlobalBasis.Z*3.5f);q.Exclude=new(){player.GetRid()};var hit=GetWorld3D().DirectSpaceState.IntersectRay(q);if(hit.Count==0)return null;var node=hit["collider"].AsGodotObject() as Node;return props.FirstOrDefault(p=>node!=null&&p.Kind is 2 or 7&&(p.Node==node||p.Node.IsAncestorOf(node)));}
 void StrikeFieldResource(){if(CoopClient){CoopRequest("chop");return;}if(dungeon!=null||game.Clock<nextChop)return;nextChop=game.Clock+.75;int family=game.Craft.HarvestTool,level=game.Craft.ToolLevels[family];var p=AimedFieldResource();if(p==null||family==1&&p.Kind!=7||family==2&&p.Kind!=2){game.Notice=family==1?"Aim a pickaxe at a rock":"Aim a mechanic tool at a wreck";return;}if(level<1||game.Stamina<8)return;if(family==2&&game.World.Changes.BurnedCars.Contains(p.Id)){game.Notice="This wreck is spent";return;}if(family==2&&level==3&&game.Craft.Fuel<1){game.Notice="Blowtorch needs fuel";return;}game.Stamina-=8;if(family==2&&level==3)game.Craft.Fuel--;p.Hits+=(int)game.HarvestPower(family);Sound(4);Noise(family==1?28:20);ImpactParticles(p.Position+Vector3.Up*.7f,family==1?new Color(.52f,.53f,.49f):new Color(.8f,.5f,.2f),8,.05f);int total=family==1?100+Math.Max(0,p.Tier-1)*15:120;game.Notice=$"HARVEST / {p.Hits}/{total}";if(p.Hits<total)return;
  if(game.Change(()=>{if(family==1){game.World.Changes.Fell(p.Id);game.Craft.Materials[1]+=4+p.Tier+game.Talent("harvest");game.Skills.Strength.Gain(60);}else{game.World.Changes.Burn(p.Id);game.Craft.ScrapMetal+=level==3?9:level==2?6:4;game.Craft.Glass+=level==3?3:2;p.Hp=0;}game.Skills.Survival.Gain(20);game.Career.Gain(12);})){if(family==1){p.Node.QueueFree();props.Remove(p);InvalidateTerrain(p.Position);}else foreach(var mesh in p.Node.FindChildren("*","MeshInstance3D",true,false).OfType<MeshInstance3D>())mesh.MaterialOverride=Material(new Color(.15f,.17f,.16f));game.Notice=family==1?"Rock broken / stone recovered":"Wreck dismantled / raw scrap metal and glass recovered";}if(CoopHost)Rpc(nameof(CoopWorldUpdate),Json.Write(WorldSnapshot()));
 }
 void FieldHarvestToolArt(Node3D n,int family,int level){if(family==0){ItemTool(n,0);if(level>=2)Box(n,new(0,.05f,-.7f),new(.2f,.08f,.25f),Steel);return;}Tube(n,new(0,-.2f,.05f),new(0,.12f,-.8f),.03f,Wood);if(family==1){Tube(n,new(-.3f,.12f,-.8f),new(.3f,.12f,-.8f),.055f,level>=2?Steel:new Color(.42f,.43f,.40f));}else if(level==1){Tube(n,new(0,.12f,-.8f),new(0,.12f,-1.0f),.015f,Steel);}else if(level==2){Tube(n,new(-.09f,.12f,-.83f),new(-.09f,.12f,-.98f),.025f,Steel);Tube(n,new(.09f,.12f,-.83f),new(.09f,.12f,-.98f),.025f,Steel);}else{Tube(n,new(0,-.12f,-.3f),new(0,.1f,-.3f),.09f,new(.55f,.35f,.14f));Tube(n,new(0,.1f,-.3f),new(0,.12f,-.95f),.03f,Steel);}}
 void ThrowFieldItem(){if(CoopRequest("fieldthrow"))return;int k=game.Craft.Throwable;if(k<0){ThrowDistraction();return;}if(game.Craft.ThrowStock[k]<1){game.Notice="No "+ExpeditionGame.ThrowableNames[k]+" / select or craft in F3";return;}string owner=game.Life.SoulOwner;if(fieldFlights.Count>=32||fieldAreas.Count>=24||fieldThrowReady.GetValueOrDefault(owner)>fieldTime||shotClock>0||reloadClock>0||game.Craft.ThrowStock[k]<1||game.Stamina<3)return;if(!game.Change(()=>{game.Craft.ThrowStock[k]--;game.Stamina-=3;}))return;fieldThrowReady[owner]=fieldTime+1;var at=camera.GlobalPosition-camera.GlobalBasis.Z*.6f;var velocity=-camera.GlobalBasis.Z*14+Vector3.Up*3;SpawnFieldFlight(k,coopActor,at,velocity);if(CoopHost)Rpc(nameof(CoopFieldFlight),k,at,velocity);game.Notice="Thrown / "+ExpeditionGame.ThrowableNames[k];}
 [Rpc(MultiplayerApi.RpcMode.Authority,TransferMode=MultiplayerPeer.TransferModeEnum.Reliable)]void CoopFieldFlight(int kind,Vector3 at,Vector3 velocity){if(CoopClient)SpawnFieldFlight(kind,-1,at,velocity);}
 void SpawnFieldFlight(int kind,long owner,Vector3 at,Vector3 velocity){Node3D model=null;if(DisplayServer.GetName()!="headless"){model=new Node3D{Position=at};AddChild(model);FieldItemArt(model,kind);model.Scale=Vector3.One*.5f;}fieldFlights.Add(new(){Kind=kind,Owner=owner,At=at,Velocity=velocity,Room=dungeon?.Id??"",Model=model});}
 Color FieldColor(int k)=>k==5?new(.7f,.12f,.09f):k==6?new(.17f,.55f,.20f):k==7?new(.16f,.35f,.72f):k is 0 or 1?new(1,.42f,.08f):new(.65f,.67f,.62f);
 void FieldItemArt(Node3D n,int kind){if(kind is 0 or 1){Tube(n,new(0,0,0),new(0,.3f,0),.075f,new(.28f,.37f,.23f));Tube(n,new(0,.30f,0),new(0,.41f,0),.025f,Cloth);}else{Bevel(n,new(0,.15f,0),new(.16f,.30f,.16f),FieldColor(kind));Tube(n,new(0,.30f,0),new(0,.36f,.05f),.012f,Steel);if(kind==9)for(int i=0;i<3;i++)Tube(n,new(-.12f,.1f+i*.06f,0),new(.12f,.1f+i*.06f,0),.008f,Steel);}}
 bool FieldLine(Vector3 a,Vector3 b){if((a-b).Length()<.1)return true;var q=PhysicsRayQueryParameters3D.Create(a+Vector3.Up*.3f,b+Vector3.Up*.8f);q.Exclude=PursuitExclusions();return GetWorld3D().DirectSpaceState.IntersectRay(q).Count==0;}
 bool FieldSmoke(Vector3 a,Vector3 b)=>fieldAreas.Any(f=>f.Kind>=4&&f.Kind<=7&&f.Room==(dungeon?.Id??"")&&Geometry3D.GetClosestPointToSegment(f.At+Vector3.Up,a,b).DistanceTo(f.At+Vector3.Up)<5);
 bool FieldStunned(Infected e){if(!fieldStuns.TryGetValue(e.Id,out double until)||until<=fieldTime)return false;e.Body.Velocity=Vector3.Zero;e.AttackState="";return true;}
 void MarkFieldDecoysDisturbed(Vector3 at,double radius){if(fieldDecoyEmission)return;foreach(var e in infected)if(Distance(e.Body.Position,at)<radius)fieldLured.Remove(e.Id);}
 bool FieldReturning(Infected e,double dt){if(!fieldLured.TryGetValue(e.Id,out var lure))return false;if(e.Hp<lure.Hp||Sight(e,Distance(e.Body.Position,player.Position))){fieldLured.Remove(e.Id);return false;}var area=fieldAreas.Find(a=>a.Id==lure.Area);if(area==null)lure.Returning=true;var goal=lure.Returning?lure.Previous:area.At;var dir=PursuitDirection(e,goal,dt);SpecialMove(e,dir.Length()>.8f?dir.Normalized()*2:Vector3.Zero,dt);e.AttackState="";e.Searching=false;e.Memory=0;e.Target=goal;if(lure.Returning&&Distance(e.Body.Position,goal)<1.2f){fieldLured.Remove(e.Id);e.Target=e.Home;}return true;}
 void IgniteFieldEnemy(Infected e,long owner,double duration,double damage){var burn=fieldBurns.Find(b=>b.Id==e.Id);if(burn==null)fieldBurns.Add(new(){Id=e.Id,Owner=owner,Left=duration,Damage=damage,Room=dungeon?.Id??""});else{burn.Left=Math.Max(duration,burn.Left);burn.Damage=Math.Max(damage,burn.Damage);burn.Owner=owner;}}
 void FieldEnemyDamage(Infected e,long owner,double damage,bool burn=false){PrimitiveOwner(owner,()=>{if(!infected.Contains(e))return;e.Hp-=damage*InfectedResistance(e,false);fieldLured.Remove(e.Id);if(!burn)ReactEnemyHit(e,false);EnemyImpact(e,e.Body.Position+Vector3.Up*.7f,Vector3.Up,3);if(e.Hp<=0)KillEnemy(e);});}
 void DetonateField(FieldFlight f){FieldDetonationVisual(f.Kind,f.At);if(CoopHost)Rpc(nameof(CoopFieldDetonation),f.Kind,f.At);if(f.Kind is 2 or 3){float radius=f.Kind==2?4:6;double damage=f.Kind==2?70:140;HearNoise(f.At,100);foreach(var e in infected.ToArray()){float dist=Distance(e.Body.Position,f.At);if(dist<radius&&FieldLine(f.At,e.Body.Position))FieldEnemyDamage(e,f.Owner,damage*(1-dist/radius));}foreach(var p in MillPlayers())if(Distance(p.Body.Position,f.At)<radius&&FieldLine(f.At,p.Body.Position))MillDamage(p.Game,p.Body,damage*(1-Distance(p.Body.Position,f.At)/radius),false);foreach(var car in props.Where(p=>p.Kind==2&&p.Hp>0&&Distance(p.Position,f.At)<radius).ToArray())PrimitiveOwner(f.Owner,()=>{car.Hp-=(int)damage;if(car.Hp<=0)ExplodeCar(car);});}
  else if(f.Kind==8){HearNoise(f.At,65);foreach(var e in infected.Where(e=>Distance(e.Body.Position,f.At)<10&&FieldLine(f.At,e.Body.Position))){fieldStuns[e.Id]=fieldTime+(IsCampaignBoss(e.Id)||IsMillBoss(e.Id)?.6:5);e.AttackState="";e.BossHits.Clear();}}
  else AddFieldArea(++fieldSerial,f.Kind,f.Owner,f.At,f.Kind==0?6:f.Kind==1?12:f.Kind==9?20:18);
  ImpactParticles(f.At+Vector3.Up*.2f,f.Kind is 2 or 3?new Color(.85f,.62f,.22f):FieldColor(f.Kind),20,.09f);
 }
 void AddFieldArea(int id,int kind,long owner,Vector3 at,double left){var a=new FieldArea{Id=id,Kind=kind,Owner=owner,At=at,Left=left,Room=dungeon?.Id??""};if(DisplayServer.GetName()!="headless"){a.Model=new Node3D{Position=at};AddChild(a.Model);if(kind==9)FieldItemArt(a.Model,9);else if(kind is 0 or 1){for(int i=0;i<8;i++){float ang=i*Mathf.Tau/8;var flame=Ellipsoid(a.Model,new(Mathf.Cos(ang)*2,.6f,Mathf.Sin(ang)*2),new(.65f,.8f,.65f),FieldColor(kind));}}else{for(int i=0;i<6;i++){var smoke=Ellipsoid(a.Model,new((i%3-1)*2,1.3f+(i/3)*1.2f,0),new(2.5f,1.8f,2.5f),FieldColor(kind));smoke.MaterialOverride=new StandardMaterial3D{AlbedoColor=new Color(FieldColor(kind),.65f),Transparency=BaseMaterial3D.TransparencyEnum.Alpha};}}}fieldAreas.Add(a);}
 List<FieldEffectState> FieldStates(Vector3 viewer)=>fieldAreas.Where(a=>Distance(a.At,viewer)<150).Select(a=>new FieldEffectState{Id=a.Id,Kind=a.Kind,X=a.At.X,Y=a.At.Y,Z=a.At.Z,Remaining=a.Left,Room=a.Room}).ToList();
 void ApplyFieldStates(List<FieldEffectState> states){states??=new();foreach(var old in fieldAreas.Where(a=>!states.Any(s=>s.Id==a.Id)).ToArray()){old.Model?.QueueFree();fieldAreas.Remove(old);}foreach(var s in states){var a=fieldAreas.Find(a=>a.Id==s.Id);if(a==null)AddFieldArea(s.Id,s.Kind,-1,new(s.X,s.Y,s.Z),s.Remaining);else a.Left=s.Remaining;}}
 void TickFieldKit(double dt){fieldTime+=dt;TickFieldJets();string room=dungeon?.Id??"";
  foreach(var f in fieldFlights.ToArray()){f.Fuse-=dt;var next=f.At+f.Velocity*(float)dt;f.Velocity+=Vector3.Down*9.8f*(float)dt;var q=PhysicsRayQueryParameters3D.Create(f.At,next);q.Exclude=PursuitExclusions();var hit=GetWorld3D().DirectSpaceState.IntersectRay(q);bool impact=hit.Count>0;if(impact){f.At=(Vector3)hit["position"]+(Vector3)hit["normal"]*.06f;f.Velocity=f.Velocity.Bounce((Vector3)hit["normal"])*.3f;}else f.At=next;if(f.Model!=null)f.Model.Position=f.At;if(f.Room!=room||f.Fuse<=0||impact&&f.Kind is not (2 or 3 or 8)){if(!CoopClient&&f.Room==room)DetonateField(f);f.Model?.QueueFree();fieldFlights.Remove(f);}}
  foreach(var a in fieldAreas.ToArray()){a.Left-=dt;if(a.Left<=0||a.Room!=room){a.Model?.QueueFree();fieldAreas.Remove(a);continue;}if(CoopClient)continue;a.Tick-=dt;if(a.Tick>0)continue;a.Tick=a.Kind==9?2:1;
   if(a.Kind==9){fieldDecoyEmission=true;try{foreach(var e in infected.Where(e=>!Peaceful(e.Id)&&(Species(e.Id)==""||Species(e.Id)=="dog")&&!IsMegaNest(e.Id)&&!IsCampaignBoss(e.Id)&&!IsMillBoss(e.Id)&&!PassiveStoryEnemy(e)&&!IsTownGuard(e.Id)&&!IsSettlementActor(e.Id)&&!IsCheckpointGuard(e.Id)&&Distance(e.Body.Position,a.At)<45)){if(!fieldLured.ContainsKey(e.Id))fieldLured[e.Id]=new(){Previous=e.Body.Position,Hp=e.Hp,Area=a.Id};else{fieldLured[e.Id].Area=a.Id;fieldLured[e.Id].Returning=false;}}HearNoise(a.At,45);}finally{fieldDecoyEmission=false;}}
   if(a.Kind is 0 or 1){float radius=a.Kind==0?3:4;double damage=a.Kind==0?6:14;foreach(var e in infected.Where(e=>Distance(e.Body.Position,a.At)<radius&&FieldLine(a.At,e.Body.Position)).ToArray()){IgniteFieldEnemy(e,a.Owner,a.Kind==0?3:6,damage);}foreach(var p in MillPlayers())if(Distance(p.Body.Position,a.At)<radius&&FieldLine(a.At,p.Body.Position))MillDamage(p.Game,p.Body,damage,false);}
  }
  if(CoopClient)return;foreach(var id in fieldStuns.Where(p=>p.Value<=fieldTime).Select(p=>p.Key).ToArray())fieldStuns.Remove(id);foreach(var id in fieldLured.Keys.Where(id=>!infected.Any(e=>e.Id==id)).ToArray())fieldLured.Remove(id);foreach(var b in fieldBurns.ToArray()){b.Left-=dt;b.Tick-=dt;var e=infected.Find(e=>e.Id==b.Id);if(e==null||b.Left<=0||b.Room!=room){fieldBurns.Remove(b);continue;}if(b.Tick<=0){b.Tick=1;ImpactParticles(e.Body.Position+Vector3.Up*.8f,new Color(.95f,.4f,.08f),6,.08f);FieldEnemyDamage(e,b.Owner,b.Damage,true);}}
 }
 void FireFieldFlamethrower(){if(game.Craft.Fuel<1){game.Notice="Flamethrower empty / craft fuel in F3";return;}if(!game.Change(()=>game.Craft.Fuel--))return;shotClock=.2;Noise(45);var from=camera.GlobalPosition;var dir=-camera.GlobalBasis.Z;FlameJetVisual(from,dir);if(CoopHost)Rpc(nameof(CoopFieldFlame),from,dir);ImpactParticles(from+dir*2,new(1,.42f,.08f),12,.12f);foreach(var e in infected.ToArray()){var delta=e.Body.Position+Vector3.Up*.9f-from;if(delta.Length()<7&&delta.Length()>.01&&dir.Dot(delta.Normalized())>.85&&FieldLine(from,e.Body.Position)){FieldEnemyDamage(e,coopActor,game.DamageFor(34,false)*.2);game.Skills.Marksmanship.Gain(1);IgniteFieldEnemy(e,coopActor,5,8);}}}
}

